                "title": "rdfs-domain-and-range-intensionality-domain",
                "rdfs:comment": "\n    RDF Semantics defines rdfs:range to have an intensional\n    reading of domain. However, semantic extensions may give an\n    extensional reading to domain. The premise/conclusion pair is\n    a non-entailment for RDFS reasoning, but may hold in semantic\n    extensions.\n  ",
                "http://www.w3.org/ns/rdftest#approval": {
                  "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/rdftest#Approved"
                },
                "mf:entailmentRegime": "RDFS",
